Here are my results on sx164 @ 533 MHz:

OpenSSL 0.9.6g 9 Aug 2002
compiler: gcc -fPIC -DTHREADS -D_REENTRANT -DDSO_DLFCN -DHAVE_DLFCN_H -mcpu=ev56 -O3 -DL_ENDIAN -DTERMIO
