OpenSSL 0.9.7a Feb 19 2003
compiler: ccc -fPIC -DOPENSSL_THREADS -D_REENTRANT -DDSO_DLFCN -DHAVE_DLFCN_H -DOPENSSL_NO_KRB5 -fast -readonly_strings -DL_ENDIAN -DTERMIO
available timing options: TIMES TIMEB HZ=1024 [sysconf value]
